        "limitRps": 100
      }
    }
  },
  "guidedHint": "A Client Limit is the most requests per second one client may send. A normal client sends about 8 and an abusive client sends 90. Set the limit above 8 so normal clients pass, and low enough that the four abusive clients cannot fill the app servers: around 10 or 15.",
